+For a database backup, stop admission, let active executions finish or cancel them, then scale the API to zero. Use the [offline check/backup/restore commands](STORAGE_RECOVERY.md) against the stopped, drained metadata database; restore requires a retained trusted checksum and a new path. Keep workload Jobs and metadata consistent. Do not copy an open database as if it were an application-consistent backup. Local metadata recovery and schema migration tests exist; active disaster recovery, cross-cluster/PVC recovery and production upgrades remain unqualified.
 
