+
+| Check | Observed result | Scope |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| `make check` | Passed vet, Go race tests, 88 Python tests, build and three compiled profile preview smokes | Code/contract and fake-backend evidence |
+| [Model graph tests](../../internal/model/run_test.go) and [Store state-machine tests](../../internal/store/state_machine_test.go) | Exhaustive state pairs, 80 Store cases and 24 seeded randomized transition sequences passed | Transactional state/history/reservation behavior |
+| [API contract tests](../../internal/api/contract_test.go) | Spec-derived route/auth/examples, stable error and strict parsing checks passed | Not a complete OpenAPI validator |
+| Native Store fuzz smoke | Passed; requested 3-second budget, 33 executions reported | Not the 1,000-crash campaign |
+| Native API fuzz smoke | Passed; requested 3-second budget, 9 executions reported | Very short parser smoke, not exhaustive fuzzing |
+| Image build + non-root/read-only preview | Passed; served exact embedded contract, rejected anonymous access and duplicate JSON, returned stable codes | No submitted workload execution |
+
+No gateway, new runtime, automatic execution retry, distributed store or cloud deployment was introduced. Phase 0 remains **in progress**. Later phase gates are not waived.
